      <item>
       <widget class="QLabel" name="cardsHelpLabel">
        <property name="text">
         <string>The cards in slots A and B are synced, raw memory cards and GCI folders alike. Each slot has one card per region: slot A's USA card here and on your other devices is the same card, even if one device uses a raw card and another a GCI folder. Newer saves arrive before a game starts; when a save changed on two devices, the newest wins and the other stays in the save's history. Wii saves are not synced.</string>
